title: Authorizations › Queue › Quick view panel
route: /authorizations?quick=R-1117
intro: The right-hand panel that opens from a queue row: a summary first, and a button to open the full case. A request that is also on the Dashboard opens the Dashboard's own request panel; a request that only the queue has opens a lighter panel built from the case. Esc closes it and focus goes back to the row.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the lighter panel's units, window and documents come from the Case Manager ledger and the case's draft where they exist. The panel changes nothing by itself; 'Review and sign' only opens New Case, where a clinician signs.
---
screen row "Queue row\nCase ID link, a small 'Quick view' icon button beside the patient, 'Open'"
click c1 "Click the icon button 'Quick view R-1117'"
click c2 "Click the row away from a link or button"
click c3 "Keyboard: Tab to the icon button, press Enter or Space"
store ad "The address gets ?quick=R-1117\nIt replaces the entry, so Back does not walk through panels\nThe row gets a green outline"
decision d1 "Is the request open and at a site in view?"
endx e1 "Nothing opens\nAn unknown, finished or other-site ID in ?quick= is dropped from the address"
decision d2 "Is the request also on the Dashboard?"
overlay o1 "The Dashboard's request panel\nSame panel, same history, 'Check now', 'Open case' and demo controls"
goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Open and read a request"
overlay o2 "Lighter quick view, from the right\nTitle 'R-1117 · Harborview MA', patient, level of care and request type"
process f1 "Focus moves into the panel (the X)\nTab and Shift+Tab stay inside it"

group gS "What the lighter panel says, in this order"
  process s1 "'Next:' line\nThe same words as the row and the case page"
  process s2 "Status chips: Preparing, Ready to sign, With the payer or Denial route\nplus 'Needs your input' and 'Coverage needs a fix' when they apply"
  process s3 "Deadline chip, e.g. 'Review due in 30 h'\nWaiting on: You, the payer or the agent"
  process s4 "Approved, used and left; Window; Documents, complete or what is missing\nOnly the ones this request has data for"
  process s5 "Site (only for a viewer who can see both sites)\nApproval chance, its word and likely range"
  process s6 "History: the last three lines with their flags (Agent, Logged decision ...)\nor 'Nothing yet'"
endgroup

click b1 "Click 'Open case'"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Ways in"
decision d3 "Is it still being prepared (Preparing or Ready to sign)?"
click b2 "Click 'Review and sign'"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Send to payer and review and sign"
process nb "No 'Review and sign'\nIt is with the payer, or a denial"
click x "Press Esc, click the X, or click the dimmed area"
process bk "The panel closes and ?quick= leaves the address\nFocus returns to that row's 'Quick view' button\nEsc closes one layer at a time (a menu or a dialog inside the panel first)"
process gn "The request leaves the queue while the panel is open\n(for example the payer answers from the Dashboard panel)\nThe panel closes by itself"
start s0 "Open /authorizations?quick=R-1117 on a fresh load"

row --> c1
row --> c2
row --> c3
c1 --> ad
c2 --> ad
c3 --> ad
s0 --> d1
ad --> d1
d1 -->|No| e1
d1 -->|Yes| d2
d2 -->|Yes| o1 --> g1
d2 -->|No| o2 --> f1
f1 --> s1 --> s2 --> s3 --> s4 --> s5 --> s6
s6 --> b1 --> g2
s6 --> d3
d3 -->|Yes| b2 --> g3
d3 -->|No| nb
o2 --> x
o1 --> x
x --> bk
o2 -.-> gn
